## Import

Import is supported using the following syntax:

{{ codefile "shell" .ImportFile }}

Import does not populate `management_server.segment_id`. `terraform plan`
will be clean even if you omit it, but for resources using
`reachability = "PRIVATE"` you should add `segment_id` back to your
configuration. Without it, the next update sends an empty segment to
the API and may mutate the live segment binding.
